    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 J. Welles Wilder《New Concepts in Technical Trading Systems》(1978) 之 **Wilder 平滑均线价上** 新核（IncredibleCharts 说明其 EMA% = 1/n，异于标准 EMA% = 2/(n+1)）。日频：若 **Close > WilderMovingAverage(14)** → 满仓 SPY，否则 BIL。不是 SMA/EMA/WMA/Hull/TEMA/DEMA 价上；不是 RSI；不是 ATR。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 1978-06-01。"
    },
